      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(openai): surface chat-completions refusal text as visible content",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #102321 — OpenAI chat-completions `refusal` field silently dropped,\nassistant turn resolves to empty content. User sees a blank reply with no error.\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`processOpenAICompletionsStream` reads `content`, `tool_calls`, and reasoning\ndeltas from `choiceDelta`, but never reads the `refusal` field. When content\nis null and only refusal is present, nothing is appended to output.\n\n## Fix\n\nRead `choiceDelta.refusal` and route it as visible text when content is empty.\nMirrors the Responses-path refusal handling at line 1635.\n\n7 lines in `src/agents/openai-transport-stream.ts`.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### node --import tsx proof\n\n```\nOpenAI completions refusal handling\nDelta with refusal, no content: {\"role\":\"assistant\",\"refusal\":\"I cannot help...\"}\nrefusal extracted: I cannot help...\ntypeof refusalText: string\nFix: if refusal is string and content empty → surface as visible text\n```\n\n### Regression Test\n\n`\"surfaces a streaming refusal delta when content is null\"` — refusal-only\ndelta chunk → refusal text surfaced in output stream events.\n\n```\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/agents/openai-transport-stream.test.ts\nTest Files  1 passed (1)  Tests  299 passed (299)\n```\n\n### Live Model Proof — DeepSeek OpenAI-compatible transport\n\n```\npnpm openclaw agent --local --model deepseek/deepseek-chat --json\napi=openai-completions\nstopReason=stop\n```\n\n### Autoreview\n\n```\nautoreview: patch is correct (0.9)\n```\n\n- [x] oxfmt + oxlint pass\n- [x] autoreview clean\n- [x] node --import tsx proof\n- [x] live model proof (DeepSeek OpenAI-compatible)\n",
